{"repo": {"timestamp": 1791168266000, "version": 20002, "name": "KabelWacht", "icon": "icon.png", "address": "https://muelli.github.io/KabelWacht/fdroid/repo", "description": "Personal F-Droid repository that publishes signed KabelWacht releases, built automatically from tagged commits in CI."}, "requests": {"install": [], "uninstall": []}, "apps": [{"allowedAPKSigningKeys": ["8f02760a5c600a686c7ff452521c7a4be9f8ced922cdc7f9fc639b068625c289"], "authorName": "Tobias Mueller", "binaries": "https://github.com/muelli/KabelWacht/releases/download/v%c/kabelwacht-%c.apk", "categories": ["Connectivity", "Security", "VPN & Proxy"], "changelog": "https://github.com/muelli/KabelWacht/releases", "suggestedVersionName": "6", "suggestedVersionCode": "117", "issueTracker": "https://github.com/muelli/KabelWacht/issues", "license": "AGPL-3.0-or-later", "sourceCode": "https://github.com/muelli/KabelWacht", "added": 1791168263000, "packageName": "com.github.muelli.kabelwacht", "lastUpdated": 1791168265000, "localized": {"en-US": {"description": "KabelWacht is a minimal, fully free-software WireGuard\u00ae client for Android.\n\nIt does one thing well: manage WireGuard tunnels and connect.\n\nFeatures:\n\n* Create, list, search, edit and delete WireGuard profiles.\n* Import a configuration by scanning a QR code or opening a .conf file.\n* Export a tunnel back to a standard wg-quick .conf file, protected by\n  device authentication \u2014 the file contains your private key.\n* One-tap connect/disconnect with a per-tunnel switch.\n* Toggle a tunnel from outside the app: launcher shortcuts, a home-screen\n  widget, or a Quick Settings tile.\n* Run conditions: let a tunnel connect and disconnect by itself depending\n  on the network \u2014 only on Wi-Fi, every Wi-Fi except the ones you list,\n  only on chosen networks, never on mobile data or while roaming, or on\n  unmetered connections only.\n* Always-on VPN support, including reconnecting after a reboot.\n* A structured editor with Interface and Peer sections, with the complete\n  wg-quick file one tap away.\n* Fully usable with a hardware keyboard \u2014 shortcuts for search, new\n  tunnel and save, and every control reachable by Tab and arrow keys.\n* Userspace WireGuard backend \u2014 no root required.\n\nPrivacy and freedom:\n\n* 100% free and open-source software (AGPL-3.0-or-later).\n* No trackers, no analytics, no advertising.\n* No Google Play Services or other proprietary dependencies.\n* The only network connection made is your own WireGuard tunnel.\n* Location permission is optional and asked for only if you set up Wi-Fi\n  network-name rules, because Android requires it to read Wi-Fi names.\n  Your location is never used or stored.\n* Release builds are reproducible: anyone can rebuild the published APK\n  from source and get the same bytes.\n\nBuilt on the official WireGuard tunnel library and the ZXing QR decoder.\n\nWireGuard is a registered trademark of Jason A. Donenfeld. This project is not\nofficially affiliated with or endorsed by the WireGuard project.\n", "icon": "icon_zzyLzh1Ecmt4ffPiOm_OK1Os0jQ8X5GkJIP8LQnJOh8=.png", "name": "KabelWacht", "phoneScreenshots": ["1.png", "2.png", "3.png", "4.png", "5.png"], "summary": "A simple, free WireGuard VPN client: scan, import, and manage tunnels.", "whatsNew": "No changes to the app itself.\n\nThis release only changes how the build is packaged and signed for\ndistribution channels outside this project's own repository.\n"}}}], "packages": {"com.github.muelli.kabelwacht": [{"added": 1791168264000, "apkName": "kabelwacht-120-rc.apk", "hash": "7e7ebca6473e15b0b66026895d6da1ac8b3497b7696c5d7286c8de4cece0747d", "hashType": "sha256", "minSdkVersion": 29, "nativecode": ["arm64-v8a", "armeabi-v7a", "x86", "x86_64"], "packageName": "com.github.muelli.kabelwacht", "sig": "74a947de067164ce2b712ba8b76f2d40", "signer": "8f02760a5c600a686c7ff452521c7a4be9f8ced922cdc7f9fc639b068625c289", "size": 16984688, "targetSdkVersion": 36, "uses-permission": 